---
title: "setLegionAddress / getLegionAddress (LegionAddressRegistry)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is authorized admin
    q_check_auth --> q_set_address: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_set: revert Unauthorized
    q_set_address --> q_validate: validate address is non-zero
    q_validate --> q_store: store registry[id] = address
    q_validate --> q_revert_set: revert InvalidAddress
    q_store --> [*]: emit AddressUpdated(id, address)
    q_revert_set --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_store
        INV-001: registry provides centralized address management for all sale contracts
        INV-002: syncLegionAddresses in sale contracts reads from this registry
        INV-003: address changes propagate to sale contracts via sync calls
    end note
